~ start
Lina: Hello adventurer.
Lina: Slimes are coming out of the dungeon and threatening the village.
Lina: Can you eliminate 5 of them?

- Yes, I will do it => accept
- Not now => refuse


~ accept
do GameState.choice = "accept_quest"
Lina: Thank you! Come back after 5 slimes are defeated.
=> END


~ refuse
Lina: All right. Come back when you are ready.
=> END


~ in_progress
Lina: The quest is in progress.
Lina: Defeat more slimes and come back.
=> END


~ ready_to_turn_in
Lina: Have you finished cleaning the dungeon?
- Yes, mission complete => turn_in
- Not yet => not_yet


~ turn_in
do GameState.choice = "turn_in_quest"
Lina: Excellent work! Here is your reward.
=> END


~ not_yet
Lina: No problem, finish the mission and come back.
=> END


~ completed
Lina: Thanks again for your help, the village is safer now.
=> END
